
---
const { waLink } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="services-section">
  <div class="services-container">

    <div class="services-header">
      <div>
        <span class="services-eyebrow">
          <span class="services-dot"></span>
          03 / LO QUE HACEMOS
        </span>

        <h2>
          Sistemas inteligentes.
          <span>Problemas reales resueltos.</span>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <p>
        No necesitas diez herramientas diferentes. Necesitas los sistemas
        adecuados para que tu negocio funcione mejor.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="services-list">

      <!-- SERVICIO 01 -->
      <article class="service-card">
        <div class="service-info">
          <div class="service-meta">
            <span class="service-number">01</span>
            <span class="service-category">GESTIÓN DE CITAS</span>
          </div>

          <h3>Tu agenda, bajo control.</h3>

          <p class="service-description">
            Deja de perseguir confirmaciones. Un sistema que recuerda
            automáticamente a tus clientes cuándo tienen una cita.
          </p>

          <ul class="service-features">
            <li><span>✓</span> Recordatorios automáticos por WhatsApp</li>
            <li><span>✓</span> Confirmaciones de asistencia</li>
            <li><span>✓</span> Opciones para reagendar</li>
            <li><span>✓</span> Seguimiento de citas</li>
          </ul>

          <a class="service-link" href={waLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Conocer esta solución <span>↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-demo appointment-demo">
          <div class="demo-window">
            <div class="demo-window-header">
              <div class="demo-window-brand">
                <span class="demo-status"></span>
                SISTEMA DE CITAS
              </div>
              <span class="demo-window-dots">•••</span>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-appointment">
              <span class="demo-label">PRÓXIMA CITA</span>
              <div class="demo-date">
                <strong>24</strong>
                <span>OCT<br/>2026</span>
              </div>
              <div class="demo-appointment-details">
                <strong>María González</strong>
                <span>Consulta · 10:30 AM</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-message">
              <div class="demo-message-top">
                <span class="demo-whatsapp">◉</span>
                <span>WHATSAPP AUTOMÁTICO</span>
                <span class="demo-sent">ENVIADO</span>
              </div>
              <p>
                ¡Hola, María! Te recordamos que tienes una cita mañana
                a las 10:30 AM. ¿Nos confirmas tu asistencia?
              </p>
              <div class="demo-message-actions">
                <span>Confirmar</span>
                <span>Reagendar</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="demo-bottom">
              <span class="demo-check">✓</span>
              Recordatorio programado
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="demo-floating-tag">
            <span>↗</span> MENOS TAREAS MANUALES
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- SERVICIO 02 -->
      <article class="service-card reverse">
        <div class="service-info">
          <div class="service-meta">
            <span class="service-number">02</span>
            <span class="service-category">REPUTACIÓN DIGITAL</span>
          </div>

          <h3>Haz que tu buen servicio se note.</h3>

          <p class="service-description">
            Facilita que los clientes satisfechos compartan su experiencia
            y construye una reputación que genere confianza.
          </p>

          <ul class="service-features">
            <li><span>✓</span> Solicitudes de reseñas automáticas</li>
            <li><span>✓</span> Enlace directo a Google</li>
            <li><span>✓</span> Mensajes personalizados</li>
            <li><span>✓</span> Seguimiento de nuevas reseñas</li>
          </ul>

          <a class="service-link" href={waLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Conocer esta solución <span>↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-demo reviews-demo">
          <div class="review-window">
            <div class="review-header">
              <div class="review-google">G</div>
              <div>
                <strong>Experiencia del cliente</strong>
                <span>Seguimiento automático</span>
              </div>
              <span class="review-live">ACTIVO</span>
            </div>

            <div class="review-stars">★★★★★</div>
            <div class="review-rating-text">
              Tu opinión ayuda a otros a encontrarnos.
            </div>

            <div class="review-divider"></div>

            <div class="review-message">
              <span class="review-message-icon">✧</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Mensaje posterior a la visita</strong>
                <p>
                  ¡Gracias por visitarnos! Nos encantaría conocer
                  tu experiencia. ¿Nos dejas una reseña?
                </p>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="review-button">
              Escribir una reseña <span>↗</span>
            </div>

            <div class="review-footer">
              <span class="demo-check">✓</span>
              Enlace directo a Google
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="demo-floating-tag">
            <span>✧</span> CONFIANZA QUE SE CONSTRUYE
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- SERVICIO 03 -->
      <article class="service-card">
        <div class="service-info">
          <div class="service-meta">
            <span class="service-number">03</span>
            <span class="service-category">RETENCIÓN DE CLIENTES</span>
          </div>

          <h3>Que tus clientes no se olviden de ti.</h3>

          <p class="service-description">
            Mantén el contacto con personas que ya compraron o visitaron
            tu negocio. Recupera conversaciones y oportunidades.
          </p>

          <ul class="service-features">
            <li><span>✓</span> Seguimiento a clientes inactivos</li>
            <li><span>✓</span> Mensajes personalizados</li>
            <li><span>✓</span> Campañas de reactivación</li>
            <li><span>✓</span> Seguimiento de respuestas</li>
          </ul>

          <a class="service-link" href={waLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            Conocer esta solución <span>↗</span>
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="service-demo followup-demo">
          <div class="followup-window">
            <div class="followup-header">
              <span class="followup-avatar">WG</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Seguimiento de clientes</strong>
                <span>Flujo de automatización</span>
              </div>
              <span class="followup-active"></span>
            </div>

            <div class="flow-node">
              <span class="flow-node-icon">◎</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Cliente sin actividad</strong>
                <span>Última visita: hace 60 días</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flow-connector">
              <span></span>
            </div>

            <div class="flow-node">
              <span class="flow-node-icon purple">◷</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Activar seguimiento</strong>
                <span>Condición cumplida</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="flow-connector">
              <span></span>
            </div>

            <div class="flow-node highlighted">
              <span class="flow-node-icon cyan">↗</span>
              <div>
                <strong>Enviar mensaje</strong>
                <span>WhatsApp personalizado</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="followup-result">
              <span class="demo-check">✓</span>
              Oportunidad de regreso
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="demo-floating-tag">
            <span>↻</span> RELACIONES QUE CONTINÚAN
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

    </div>

    <div class="services-cta">
      <div>
        <span class="services-cta-label">NO TODOS LOS NEGOCIOS SON IGUALES</span>
        <h3>Tu negocio necesita su propio sistema.</h3>
        <p>Analizamos cómo trabajas y diseñamos una solución a tu medida.</p>
      </div>

      <a href={waLink} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
        Hablemos de tu negocio <span>↗</span>
      </a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .services-section {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: 115px 0;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 45%, rgba(139,92,246,.06), transparent 40%),
      #090912;
  }

  .services-container {
    width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 48px));
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .services-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: end;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-bottom: 65px;
  }

  .services-eyebrow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    color: #a78bfa;
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .15em;
  }

  .services-dot {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #22d3ee;
    box-shadow: 0 0 12px #22d3ee;
  }

  .services-header h2 {
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0;
    color: #f4f2ff;
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 4.1rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -.065em;
    line-height: 1.06;
  }

  .services-header h2 span {
    display: block;
    background: linear-gradient(100deg, #a78bfa, #8b5cf6, #22d3ee);
    background-clip: text;
    -webkit-background-clip: text;
    color: transparent;
  }

  .services-header > p {
    max-width: 330px;
    margin: 0 0 5px;
    color: #a3a2b9;
    font-size: .95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .services-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 22px;
  }

  .service-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .9fr 1.1fr;
    gap: 45px;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 430px;
    padding: 40px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.16);
    border-radius: 22px;
    background:
      linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(139,92,246,.045), transparent 65%),
      #11111e;
  }

  .service-card.reverse .service-info {
    order: 2;
  }

  .service-card.reverse .service-demo {
    order: 1;
  }

  .service-meta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 13px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }

  .service-number {
    color: #a78bfa;
    font-size: .85rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .service-category {
    color: #89869f;
    font-size: .62rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .13em;
  }

  .service-info h3 {
    max-width: 450px;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
    color: #f4f2ff;
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 3.1vw, 2.65rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -.055em;
    line-height: 1.1;
  }

  .service-description {
    max-width: 430px;
    margin: 0 0 24px;
    color: #a3a2b9;
    font-size: .94rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .service-features {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .service-features li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    color: #d0cede;
    font-size: .85rem;
  }

  .service-features li span {
    color: #22d3ee;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .service-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    color: #c4b5fd;
    font-size: .88rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color .2s, gap .2s;
  }

  .service-link:hover {
    gap: 18px;
    color: #22d3ee;
  }

  /* DEMOSTRACIONES */

  .service-demo {
    position: relative;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    min-height: 330px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.12);
    border-radius: 17px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(139,92,246,.13), transparent 65%),
      #0b0b16;
  }

  .demo-window,
  .review-window,
  .followup-window {
    width: min(100% - 50px, 390px);
    padding: 20px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.2);
    border-radius: 15px;
    background: rgba(20,19,37,.96);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 55px rgba(0,0,0,.3);
  }

  .demo-window-header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }

  .demo-window-brand {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 9px;
    color: #aaa8c0;
    font-size: .61rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .1em;
  }

  .demo-status,
  .followup-active {
    width: 7px;
    height: 7px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #22d3ee;
    box-shadow: 0 0 9px #22d3ee;
  }

  .demo-window-dots {
    color: #77738f;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
  }

  .demo-appointment {
    padding: 20px 0;
  }

  .demo-label {
    color: #88869e;
    font-size: .58rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
  }

  .demo-date {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 12px 0;
  }

  .demo-date strong {
    color: #f4f2ff;
    font-size: 2.5rem;
    letter-spacing: -.06em;
  }

  .demo-date span {
    color: #a78bfa;
    font-size: .66rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .demo-appointment-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .demo-appointment-details strong {
    color: white;
    font-size: .83rem;
  }

  .demo-appointment-details span {
    color: #9290a7;
    font-size: .72rem;
  }

  .demo-message {
    padding: 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,.16);
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: rgba(34,211,238,.045);
  }

  .demo-message-top {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    color: #a3a2b9;
    font-size: .53rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .06em;
  }

  .demo-whatsapp {
    color: #22d3ee;
    font-size: .95rem;
  }

  .demo-sent {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: #4ade80;
    font-size: .5rem;
  }

  .demo-message p {
    margin: 13px 0;
    color: #d9d7e9;
    font-size: .72rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .demo-message-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .demo-message-actions span {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 8px 5px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(34,211,238,.25);
    border-radius: 6px;
    color: #67e8f9;
    font-size: .62rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .demo-bottom,
  .review-footer,
  .followup-result {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin-top: 16px;
    color: #9d9bb1;
    font-size: .65rem;
  }

  .demo-check {
    color: #4ade80;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .demo-floating-tag {
    position: absolute;
    right: 15px;
    bottom: 15px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 9px 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: #17152a;
    color: #aaa8c0;
    font-size: .55rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .08em;
  }

  .demo-floating-tag span {
    color: #22d3ee;
  }

  /* RESEÑAS */

  .review-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .review-google {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.07);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .review-header > div:nth-child(2) {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
  }

  .review-header strong {
    color: #f0efff;
    font-size: .72rem;
  }

  .review-header > div span {
    color: #9290a7;
    font-size: .61rem;
  }

  .review-live {
    margin-left: auto;
    color: #4ade80;
    font-size: .53rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .review-stars {
    margin-top: 26px;
    color: #facc15;
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    letter-spacing: .13em;
  }

  .review-rating-text {
    margin-top: 5px;
    color: #c4c2d5;
    font-size: .78rem;
  }

  .review-divider {
    height: 1px;
    margin: 22px 0;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }

  .review-message {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .review-message-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: rgba(139,92,246,.15);
    color: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .review-message strong {
    color: #eeeaff;
    font-size: .73rem;
  }

  .review-message p {
    margin: 7px 0 0;
    color: #a3a2b9;
    font-size: .7rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  .review-button {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 20px;
    padding: 12px 14px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.3);
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(139,92,246,.12);
    color: #c4b5fd;
    font-size: .7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  /* SEGUIMIENTO */

  .followup-header {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 23px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }

  .followup-avatar {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 34px;
    height: 34px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #22d3ee);
    color: white;
    font-size: .65rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .followup-header > div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .followup-header strong {
    color: #f0efff;
    font-size: .73rem;
  }

  .followup-header > div span {
    color: #9290a7;
    font-size: .61rem;
  }

  .followup-active {
    margin-left: auto;
  }

  .flow-node {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    padding: 12px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(167,139,250,.15);
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.025);
  }

  .flow-node.highlighted {
    border-color: rgba(34,211,238,.3);
    background: rgba(34,211,238,.055);
  }

  .flow-node-icon {
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    border-radius: 8px;
    background: rgba(255,255,255,.06);
    color: #c4c2d5;
  }

  .flow-node-icon.purple {
    background: rgba(139,92,246,.15);
    color: #c4b5fd;
  }

  .flow-node-icon.cyan {
    background: rgba(34,211,238,.12);
    color: #67e8f9;
  }

  .flow-node div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .flow-node strong {
    color: #eae8fa;
    font-size: .71rem;
  }

  .flow-node div span {
    color: #9290a7;
    font-size: .61rem;
  }

  .flow-connector {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    height: 20px;
  }

  .flow-connector span {
    width: 1px;
    background: linear-gradient(#8b5cf6, #22d3ee);
  }

  .followup-result {
    justify-content: center;
    padding-top: 15px;
    border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08);
  }

  /* CTA FINAL */

  .services-cta {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 30px;
    margin-top: 55px;
    padding: 35px 40px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(139,92,246,.25);
    border-radius: 17px;
    background:
      radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 50%, rgba(139,92,246,.15), transparent 55%),
      #11101e;
  }

  .services-cta-label {
    color: #a78bfa;
    font-size: .61rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: .12em;
  }

  .services-cta h3 {
    margin: 10px 0 7px;
    color: #f4f2ff;
    font-size: 1.45rem;
    letter-spacing: -.04em;
  }

  .services-cta p {
    margin: 0;
    color: #a3a2b9;
    font-size: .85rem;
  }

  .services-cta > a {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 18px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    padding: 15px 19px;
    border-radius: 9px;
    background: linear-gradient(110deg, #8b5cf6, #6d5ae8);
    color: white;
    font-size: .82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-decoration: none;
    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(139,92,246,.18);
    transition: transform .2s, box-shadow .2s;
  }

  .services-cta > a:hover {
    transform: translateY(-3px);
    box-shadow: 0 0 35px rgba(139,92,246,.35);
  }

  @media (max-width: 850px) {
    .services-header {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .service-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 30px;
      padding: 30px;
    }

    .service-card.reverse .service-info,
    .service-card.reverse .service-demo {
      order: initial;
    }

    .service-demo {
      min-height: 350px;
    }

    .services-cta {
      align-items: flex-start;
      flex-direction: column;
    }
  }

